        "Title": "Nothing Persona(l) 1: Back alley doctor",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110624425476",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1f9b3262-f7b9-448a-9157-0f67a8e1596c).Image",
        "Description": "47,\ryour mission is to hinder a certain rebel group&apos;s operations by taking Tae Takemi, a doctor residing in Yongen-Jaya who supplied them with medicines, out of the equation. She cannot be killed, so our clients attempted to cause a mental breakdown in her, but as their method failed, they resolved to more conventional ways- killing her brother. As he was unreachable too, they hired us. \rTo make it look like a mental breakdown, you mustn&apos;t leave any traces of your presence.\rGood hunting,\rDiana",
